WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.055
Mark: But . . . But . . . What did I do?

2
00:00:05.056 --> 00:00:07.173
Miss Gray: You stepped over the line.

3
00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:10.309
Miss Gray: And you didn't tell the truth about it.

4
00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:13.080
Sit down, Mark.

5
00:00:13.081 --> 00:00:15.680
Mark: I didn't step over the line!

6
00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:18.279
Kara's just saying that.

7
00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.159
Kara: You did so.

8
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.459
You cheated!

9
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.976
Miss Gray: That's enough!

10
00:00:24.977 --> 00:00:27.673
The girls won round two.

11
00:00:27.674 --> 00:00:29.938
Miss Gray: Pick up the rope again, everybody.

12
00:00:29.939 --> 00:00:32.629
Miss Gray: We'll play one more time.

13
00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:42.576
Then it will be time to write our letters.

14
00:00:42.577 --> 00:00:46.093
Mark: I don't like second grade anymore.

15
00:00:46.094 --> 00:00:52.561
I can't wait until summer!

16
00:00:52.562 --> 00:01:01.167
Miss Gray: Boys and girls, here's some paper.

17
00:01:01.168 --> 00:01:04.925
Miss Gray: Please start writing your letters now.

18
00:01:04.926 --> 00:01:06.547
Jim: I don't get it.

19
00:01:06.548 --> 00:01:09.099
What are we supposed to do?

20
00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:12.197
Daisy: Write letters to the kids in Room Two next year.

21
00:01:12.198 --> 00:01:15.463
Coby: And tell them about all the fun stuff we did.

22
00:01:15.464 --> 00:01:18.444
Jenna: This is making me sad.

23
00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:20.977
But it's a little fun too.

24
00:01:20.978 --> 00:01:25.405
Jenna: I'm going to write about mouse math.

25
00:01:25.406 --> 00:01:28.566
Daisy: I'm going to tell the kids about Picture Day.

26
00:01:28.567 --> 00:01:30.088
Jim: I'm stuck.

27
00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:32.576
I don't know what to write.

28
00:01:32.577 --> 00:01:36.017
Coby: Me neither.

29
00:01:36.018 --> 00:01:38.558
Jim: What are you writing about, Mark?

30
00:01:38.559 --> 00:01:41.631
Miss Gray and how nice she is?

31
00:01:41.632 --> 00:01:45.108
Mark: Nope. Just some stuff.

32
00:01:45.109 --> 00:01:46.580
Mark: Dear Kids,

33
00:01:46.581 --> 00:01:50.262
Sorry to tell you this, but Room Two stinks.

34
00:01:50.263 --> 00:01:54.455
Mark: Miss Gray is not fun or nice.

35
00:01:54.456 --> 00:01:58.153
She is mean and . . .

